\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Architecture of the proposed Adaptive Parameter Synthesis Agent. The system processes multi-modal inputs (text and audio) through a perception layer, retrieves relevant knowledge from semantic and episodic memory, fuses information via adaptive multimodal fusion, and executes parameter synthesis through retrieval, selection, and validation. A learning loop enables continuous improvement through user feedback and AEM updates.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
